  "recorded": "2026-09-29",
  "notes": {
    "screenshots/pos-payment-matrix": "Real Electron app (CDP) against a guarded disposable Laravel backend; EN/AR x light/dark x 4 viewports; POS page and payment dialog. automatedLayoutCheck: no horizontal page scroll, dialog inside the viewport, primary (F9) action visible.",
    "screenshots/done-screen": "Completed-sale screen after a real exact-cash sale.",
    "screenshots/owner-dashboard": "Owner SPA (isolated headless Chrome) against the same disposable backend; register presence after the till relaunched.",
    "screenshots/sync-needs-attention": "live-pending-*: real unanswered reservation request (server stopped mid-request) and the waiting payment. legacy-cancel-acknowledgement-*: the real cancel acknowledgement. final-*: after the real legacy cancel (ONE SIMULATED PRECONDITION: the attempt was marked dispatch_evidence=unknown, exactly what migration 0016 writes for an attempt claimed by an older build) and after the pending request was confirmed automatically on reconnection.",
    "walkthrough": "live-01 shows a DEFECT found live (false \"exact-cash payment was removed\" notice), fixed afterwards; live-02 honest no-stock refusal; live-03 offline x10 gate before the \"Only N reserved\" wording; live-04 done screen after the fix.",
    "reproduction": "Pre-fix reproduction: unmodified desktop build 8bf0154 against a read-only git-archive copy of backend HEAD 1479622."
  },
